    "title": "A message instead of the work",
    "body": "Now the app server saves the order and puts one message, \"order 123 placed\", on a **queue** kept by a **message broker** (about 5 ms), then answers. The customer waits about 30 + 5 = **35 ms**. The email, the invoice and the warehouse call still happen, a moment later, done by **workers** that take messages from the queue: this is **asynchronous work**. The app server is the **producer**; the workers are the **consumers**.",
