  {
    "title": "The warehouse is down",
    "body": "The warehouse's API stops answering. Retrying at once, again and again, would add load just when it can least take it. The worker **retries with exponential backoff**: it waits 1, 2, 4, 8 and 16 seconds, 31 seconds in all, plus a little random **jitter** so that thousands of messages do not retry at the same moment. A message that still fails after its last retry goes to a **dead-letter queue**, where a person can look at it, instead of being retried forever.",
